@baseUrl = http://localhost:5207

### RetrieveCustomer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/client/12345678
MessageIdentifier: abc-12345
DeviceIdentifier: dev-001
ChannelIdentifier: http-file

### RetrieveAccount
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account/001
MessageIdentifier: abc-12345

### InitiatePaymentExecution: change the reference for a new operation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
MessageIdentifier: abc-12345

{
  "transactionReference": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
  "customerNationalId": "12345678",
  "sourceAccountNumber": "001",
  "destinationAccountNumber": "EXTERNA",
  "destinationBank": "BANCO_B",
  "amount": 100,
  "otpCode": null
}

### RetrievePaymentExecution
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
MessageIdentifier: abc-12345
